Replacement of Cereal with Low Starch
Fibrous By-Products on Nutrients Utilization
and Methane Emissions in Dairy Goats
Carla Ibáñez1, Vicente Javier Moya2, Haritz Arriaga3, Diana María López3, Pilar Merino3,
