Valuable Biomolecules from Nine North
Atlantic Red Macroalgae: Amino Acids,
Fatty Acids, Carotenoids, Minerals
and Metals
Behnaz Razi Parjikolaei1*, Annette Bruhn2, Karin Loft Eybye3, Martin Mørk Larsen4,
Michael Bo Rasmussen2, Knud Villy Christensen1, Xavier C. Fretté1
1

