maintained at 0 Celsius (˚C) to 4˚C until immediately before analysis.
The concentration of arsenic was measured at the International Centre for Diarrhoeal Disease Research, Bangladesh (ICDDR,B) laboratory by the silver diethyldithiocarbamate method
