3.3.2 Sampling Method
The purposive sampling was used to pick the LGAs
where there was an established agricultural activity and
environmental risks were documented. Systematic
random sampling in each LGA picked samples of soils
and crops in various farms at set intervals.

Quality control involved certified reference materials,
duplication, blank determinations and check of
calibration-curve.
